        <li><p class="stat">25+</p><p>federal standards require a formal Method 21 LDAR program at gas plants, terminals, and refineries. NSPS OOOOa and OOOOb added well sites and compressor stations.</p><p class="stat-source">— EPA, See <a href="/ldar-rule-map">LDAR rule map</a>, 2026</p></li>
        <li><p class="stat">$1,500</p><p>per ton of excess methane for large emitters under the Waste Emissions Charge. Set in statute from 2026 on, but not enforced: Congress delayed it to 2034, and it could still be implemented.</p><p class="stat-source">— Clean Air Act §136(c); One Big Beautiful Bill Act, 2025</p></li>        <li><p class="stat">28x</p><p>Methane's GWP under the GHG Reporting Program. Every open day counts 28 times over.</p><p class="stat-source">— 40 CFR 98, Table A-1</p></li>
